{"id":"ac2460aba5c368e5","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-primrec-operator.md","title":"Primitive Recursion Operator","display":"df-primrec-operator — Primitive Recursion Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-primrec-operator","aliases":["90-df-primrec-operator","90-df-PrimRec"],"display":"df-primrec-operator — Primitive Recursion Operator","depends_on":["[[90-df-omega]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-primrec-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-primrec-operator</span><span>90-df-PrimRec</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primrec-operator — Primitive Recursion Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 为全函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}\\)</span>。自然数递归的背景取原自然数集语境 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9846c377383d14c1\" href=\"?note=9846c377383d14c1\" title=\"90-df-omega\">90-df-omega</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\">\\(\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle\\)</span> 是集合论有限列连接，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\vec x,n)\">\\(f(\\vec x,n)\\)</span> 是在该 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(k+1)\">\\((k+1)\\)</span> 元组上的函数应用；不使用数值序列码的追加运算。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_{g,h}(\\vec x,n,z)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land n,z\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\ \\bigl[\na_0=g(\\vec x)\\land a_n=z\\land\n\\forall j&lt;n\\ a_{j+1}=h(\\vec x,j,a_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists!z\\in\\mathbb N\\ R_{g,h}(\\vec x,n,z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h)\\ &amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle,z):\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land n,z\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land R_{g,h}(\\vec x,n,z)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h):\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_{g,h}(\\vec x,n,z)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ &amp;\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land n,z\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\ \\bigl[\na_0=g(\\vec x)\\land a_n=z\\land\n\\forall j&lt;n\\ a_{j+1}=h(\\vec x,j,a_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists!z\\in\\mathbb N\\ R_{g,h}(\\vec x,n,z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h)\\ &amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle,z):\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land n,z\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land R_{g,h}(\\vec x,n,z)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h):\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\quad\nf=\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left[\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ f(\\vec x,0)=g(\\vec x)\n\\right]\\land\\left[\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\nf(\\vec x,n+1)=h(\\vec x,n,f(\\vec x,n))\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\quad\nf=\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left[\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ f(\\vec x,0)=g(\\vec x)\n\\right]\\land\\left[\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\nf(\\vec x,n+1)=h(\\vec x,n,f(\\vec x,n))\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留递归变量在最后、步函数最后两项为阶段及前值的原调用。存在唯一性由有限递归见证及归纳证明，不要求对象理论统一证明所有递归函数的全性。该元理论图定义是定义性保守扩张，不是自由指定的同名函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-omega]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-omega","status":"resolved","id":"9846c377383d14c1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$k\\in\\mathbb N$；$g:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N$、$h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N$ 为全函数；$\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}$。自然数递归的背景取原自然数集语境 [[90-df-omega]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N^{k+2}\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N^0=\\{\\langle\\rangle\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\vec x,n)","display":false},{"tex":"(k+1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_{g,h}(\\vec x,n,z)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ &\n\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land n,z\\in\\mathbb N\\land\n\\exists a\\in\\mathbb N^{n+1}\\ \\bigl[\na_0=g(\\vec x)\\land a_n=z\\land\n\\forall j<n\\ a_{j+1}=h(\\vec x,j,a_j)\\bigr],\\\\\n&\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists!z\\in\\mathbb N\\ R_{g,h}(\\vec x,n,z),\\\\\n\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h)\\ &\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\vec x{}^\\frown\\langle n\\rangle,z):\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\land n,z\\in\\mathbb N\n\\land R_{g,h}(\\vec x,n,z)\\},\\\\\n&\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h):\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall f:\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\quad\nf=\\operatorname{PrimRec}(g,h)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\left[\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ f(\\vec x,0)=g(\\vec x)\n\\right]\\land\\left[\n\\forall\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^k\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\nf(\\vec x,n+1)=h(\\vec x,n,f(\\vec x,n))\n\\right].","display":true}],"bytes":1864,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6b94974722658c7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6198f000bea16af4","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z,S,\\pi_i^n$ 见 [[90-df-zero-function]]、[[90-df-successor-function]]、[[90-df-projection-function]]；$Z$ 仍为一元零函数。$\\mathrm{Closure}$ 见 [[90-df-closure-operator]]。复合与原始递归见 [[90-df-composition-operator]]、[[90-df-primrec-operator]]；$\\mathcal O_{\\mathrm{PR}}$ 是 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]] 已定义的、在类型不相容输入上返回 $Z$ 的全算子族。$f$ 为候选有限元数值全函数。此处保留本册的 $\\mathrm{Base},\\mathrm{PR}$ 名称和同一正元基底。"},{"id":"220648f3ca864e2c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRec}$ (primitive-recursion operator, see [[90-df-primrec-operator]])"},{"id":"b13ec70aec8d64a6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-primrec-operator]] — 原始递归算子"},{"id":"46caa19bb1e0ac82","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-primrec-operator]] — 原始递归算子"},{"id":"88d284a5e496e4ef","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PrimRec}$ (primitive-recursion operator, see [[90-df-primrec-operator]])"},{"id":"93165ca56749f325","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal F,\\mathrm{PR},Z,S,\\pi_i^k$ 取 [[90-df-primitive-recursive]]；$\\operatorname{Comp},\\operatorname{PrimRec}$ 取 [[90-df-composition-operator]]、[[90-df-primrec-operator]]。"},{"id":"abc082683aa1de80","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Comp}$ 取 [[90-df-composition-operator]]，只在正元数相容参数上应用；$\\operatorname{PrimRec}$ 取 [[90-df-primrec-operator]]，递归参数位于最后。"},{"id":"1e6602d1acf4aceb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"da1a6647840ffca5","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-composition-operator]]、[[90-df-primrec-operator]]"},{"id":"32c1f47762a7f658","anchor":"ref-73","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[90-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[90-df-addition-function.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetic-language.md]]\n[[90-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[90-df-berry-paradox.md]]\n[[90-df-cantor-diagonal.md]]\n[[90-df-closure-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-comparison-function.md]]\n[[90-df-compcode.md]]\n[[90-df-composition-operator.md]]\n[[90-df-conditional-function.md]]\n[[90-df-conf-proj.md]]\n[[90-df-configuration.md]]\n[[90-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[90-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[90-df-decidable-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-closure.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[90-df-diagonalization.md]]\n[[90-df-divisibility.md]]\n[[90-df-divrem-function.md]]\n[[90-df-effective-procedure.md]]\n[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[90-df-essentially-undecidable.md]]\n[[90-df-factorial-function.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point-theorem.md]]\n[[90-df-fixed-point.md]]\n[[90-df-formula.md]]\n[[90-df-free-variable.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-number.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-numbering.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-sentence.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system-definition.md]]\n[[90-df-godel-system.md]]\n[[90-df-halt-notation.md]]\n[[90-df-haltseq.md]]\n[[90-df-hbl-conditions.md